  "description": "Seduce a man you just met and marry him in a week? \n\nOn the eve of her sister's wedding, Princess Liët of Chalonne meets the imperial prince sent as a congratulatory envoy. But instead of gifts, this prince delivers a threat.\n\n *“Marry my cousin, Cain, and uncover his weakness.”\n\n“If a princess about to marry were to pass away... wouldn't that be a tragedy?”*\n\nTo protect her sister, Liët attempts to seduce Cain, the Iron Archduke known as an ice pick, an artificial being. But she hits a wall from the start.\n\n *“Please refrain from approaching me.”*\n\nCain effortlessly deflects all of Liet's efforts. Eventually, Liet even proposes a contract marriage, determined to become his wife... \n\n *“You seemed quite exhausted last night, so I'll be gentle today.”*\n\nThe impenetrable fortress that was Cain vanishes without a trace, and he begins to cling to Liet like a dog...?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
